  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "天无三日晴。地无三尺平。人无三分银。三句老话，把贵阳钉在“穷山恶水”的耻辱柱上几百年。直到一位德国地理学家站在黔灵山顶，问了我一句话：“全世界没有第二个省会，建在85%的喀斯特地貌上。”那一刻我才明白——贵阳不是穷，是不认命#贵阳#中国历史名城",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_b199dcc6960a2707_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 609.13,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "贵阳可能是全中国最被看不起的省会，没有之一。大多数人提到，贵州脑子里蹦出来的就是三句话，天无三日晴，地无三尺，平人无三分银。好像这块土地自古就是偏远落后，没文化的代名词。我前些年也这么觉得。西南f四里成都重庆光芒太盛，贵阳夹在中间，像个闷葫芦存在感低到尘埃里。直到去年，一位研究全球山地文明的德国地理学家把我点醒了，他叫汉斯穆勒，海德堡大学的地貌学教授，研究全球喀斯特山地城市与人类定居关系，研究了快三十年。他这趟来中国行程单上，原本只有桂林和昆明，但他自己加了一站，说死都要来贵阳。到了贵林，贵阳，他没去甲秀楼，也没去青岩古镇，直接让人把他拉到乾灵山最高处，俯瞰整座城市。他站在那看了整整一个小时，山风把头发吹得乱七八糟。他就一直盯着脚下，那些从山缝里长出来的娄，然后他突然转过头问我，你知道这座城市最让我震撼的是什么吗？我说山多呗，喀斯特地貌嘛，他摇头，他说全世界没有。第二个省会是建在百分之八十五的喀斯特地貌上。那一刻，我突然觉得自己之前对贵阳那些偏远落后的标签遣拨到家了。第一季闷锤，全世界的城市都找平地画格子只有贵阳在百分之八十五都是山河溶洞的土地上，硬生生扎下根来贵阳的地貌，山地、丘陵占百分之八十四点六一，平坝只有百分之十五点三九。这意味着什么？意味着你在这座城市里，随便找个地方往下挖，底下可能是空的。溶洞暗河裂隙平地少到可怜，还被纵横交错的水系切割的七零八落。可就是这样一块被地理学家，称为不适合建大城市的土地上，长出了一座六百四十万人口的省会。德国专家说了一句话，让我后背发凉。你们中国人在这种地质条件下建城，在欧洲人看来，等于在筛子上盖教堂第二，蓟门锤更狠。第二天，我们钻进了老城区，那些弯弯绕绕的巷子，贵阳不像重庆那样，把楼直接种在山崖上。贵阳市山中有城，城中有山，汉斯蹲在一条叫坡的巷子口，对贵阳的路不叫路叫破老。贵阳有十八坡、望城婆、大营婆和上坡陈家坡、莲花坡。你听这些名字，每一个都是一座实实在在的山望城坡，顾名思义，就是能望见贵阳城的坡大营坡。几乎全贵阳人都知道河上坡。在今天白云大道，他用手摸着那些被岁月磨圆的青石板。突然问我，你注意到没有？贵阳人从来没有试图把山铲平。他说，全世界山地城市的逻辑就两种，要么推山填谷造平地，要么像重庆那样把楼架在山壁上。但贵阳选了第三条路，他绕着山走山在这儿，路就拐个弯儿泼在那儿，房子就顺着坡盖几十年了，贵阳人硬是没动过那些山的基本轮廓。他站起来指着远处说，你们贵阳人不是在修城市，你们是在卡斯特的骨头缝里绣花，每一栋楼每一条路都是顺着地形的纹理长出来的。这种对自然的敬畏，不是妥协，是智慧。然后他说了一句让我头皮发麻的话，我们欧洲人搞了几百年。城市规划讲究的是改造自然，征服地形哦。但你们贵阳人从一开始就想明白了一件事，最高级的文明不是让山河沉浮，是知道什么时候该绕着走。第三季闷锤，我们去了一个谁也想不到的地方。贵阳三县建设博物馆汉斯站在那些老照片和老物件前，看了很久，突然转过头问我，你知道为什么贵阳能从一座边陲小城变成今天的西南枢纽吗？我愣了愣。他说，因为你们贵阳人把被选择变成了，接得住。一九六四年三县建设启动国家一址调令数万名工人技术员工程师、携家带口技术、海北京、沈阳哈尔滨。这些大城市挤上孟灌货车，翻过重鸾叠嶂，落脚在这片全然木场陌生的土地。十五年间，一百多个项目从沿海迁入贵州，仅内迁，职工就超过七万人。设备一万二千余台相当于搬走了好几座中型城市上海光学仪器厂整体迁到乌当区新天寨的山窝窝里，在代号八百零三的四层小楼中，硬是造出了中国第一台潜艇潜望镜。上海第二电表厂上海电表厂迁到贵阳，组建了西南电表公司。上海大中华橡胶厂整体内迁，贵阳组建贵州橡胶总厂，北京轴承厂一拆为二，一半来贵阳小河扎根。后来，GY排轴承远销七十多个国家和地区，拿下了全国五一劳动奖状，还有永恒精密电表厂紧挨着油炸街的火焰山生产的产品参与研制。北京正负电子对撞机名字被永远刻在了国家科委的铭文碑上。汉斯站在博物馆里一字一句的说，你知道这意味着什么吗？这不是一座城市的幸运，这是一座城市的品格。你们贵阳人没有挑三拣四，不管国家扔进来什么，你们都接住了。上海人来了，贵阳人没排外，东北人来了，贵阳人没嫌弃，你们把山挖开，把路修通，把厂建起来，山沟里硬生生长出了一座现代工业城。他顿了顿又说，更让我震撼的是，你们不但截住了，还长出了新的东西。六十年前三线建设打下的工业底子，六十年后变成了什么？变成了今天贵阳的中国树谷，那些曾经的三线工厂，如今变成了大数据产业园，机械加工车间，变成了软件测试实验室。凉爽的气候，稳定的地址、充足的水电当年是三县建设选址的理由，今天成了大数据产业扎根的土壤。从潜望镜到云计算，从山洞里的机床到云端上的代码。你们贵阳人用六十年证明了一件事儿，你给我什么样的地，我就能活出什么样的人。你给我什么样的时代，我就能借住什么样的未来。我站在博物馆里，看着墙上那些黑白照片里年轻的脸，他们从上海来，从北京来，从东北来，有的连贵州在哪都不知道，就到了了。他们这辈子没回去，把青春和子孙都留在了这片喀斯特的山地上。回来之后，我怎么也放不下这件事。搜了一圈资料，发现大部分文章都在讲贵阳有多爽有多凉快。很少有人讲贵阳背后那个文明级别的生存选择。后来翻到那套中国历史名城，翻到贵阳那部分一口气读完，他不是把贵阳当一个避暑城市来写，他掰开了讲，为什么中国人敢在百分之八十五都是卡斯特的山地上见省会？为什么山城不是被迫接受，而是主动共生？为什么中国文明能把一块地无三里坪的土地活成西南枢纽？每一页翻开都是一句，原来我们的祖宗在不可能，这三个字面前从来没低过头。下次你要是来贵阳，别光在甲秀楼拍张游客照就走了。翻一翻这套书，带一双看得懂的眼睛走进去，这座在卡斯特骨头缝里绣了六百多年花的山城。等的不是一个游客说挺凉快，然后走掉。等的是，终于有个中国人站在乾灵山顶说，我知道你是什么你是我的祖宗。在一堆石头缝里跟这片山地达成的一个约定，至今没有毁约放在橱窗里了。点左下角头像主页，橱窗就能看到一顿肠旺面加两份翠少的钱，把中国人在不可能的土地上活出可能的骨气，原原本本带回家。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00001",
      "start_ms": 150,
      "end_ms": 3750,
      "text": "贵阳可能是全中国最被看不起的省会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00002",
      "start_ms": 3990,
      "end_ms": 4770,
      "text": "没有之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5630,
      "end_ms": 6850,
      "text": "大多数人提到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6850,
      "end_ms": 9850,
      "text": "贵州脑子里蹦出来的就是三句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10290,
      "end_ms": 11530,
      "text": "天无三日晴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11750,
      "end_ms": 12670,
      "text": "地无三尺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00007",
      "start_ms": 12730,
      "end_ms": 14770,
      "text": "平人无三分银。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00008",
      "start_ms": 15070,
      "end_ms": 18890,
      "text": "好像这块土地自古就是偏远落后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00009",
      "start_ms": 19290,
      "end_ms": 20930,
      "text": "没文化的代名词。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00010",
      "start_ms": 21370,
      "end_ms": 22890,
      "text": "我前些年也这么觉得。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00011",
      "start_ms": 23230,
      "end_ms": 26250,
      "text": "西南f四里成都重庆光芒太盛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00012",
      "start_ms": 26730,
      "end_ms": 27930,
      "text": "贵阳夹在中间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00013",
      "start_ms": 28150,
      "end_ms": 31840,
      "text": "像个闷葫芦存在感低到尘埃里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00014",
      "start_ms": 32580,
      "end_ms": 33520,
      "text": "直到去年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00015",
      "start_ms": 33780,
      "end_ms": 38780,
      "text": "一位研究全球山地文明的德国地理学家把我点醒了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00016",
      "start_ms": 38860,
      "end_ms": 40460,
      "text": "他叫汉斯穆勒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00017",
      "start_ms": 41400,
      "end_ms": 43640,
      "text": "海德堡大学的地貌学教授，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00018",
      "start_ms": 43980,
      "end_ms": 48720,
      "text": "研究全球喀斯特山地城市与人类定居关系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00019",
      "start_ms": 48720,
      "end_ms": 50220,
      "text": "研究了快三十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00020",
      "start_ms": 51180,
      "end_ms": 53920,
      "text": "他这趟来中国行程单上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00021",
      "start_ms": 53960,
      "end_ms": 55840,
      "text": "原本只有桂林和昆明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00022",
      "start_ms": 56220,
      "end_ms": 57580,
      "text": "但他自己加了一站，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00023",
      "start_ms": 57800,
      "end_ms": 58980,
      "text": "说死都要来贵阳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00024",
      "start_ms": 58980,
      "end_ms": 60010,
      "text": "到了贵林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00025",
      "start_ms": 60050,
      "end_ms": 60405,
      "text": "贵阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00026",
      "start_ms": 60710,
      "end_ms": 61885,
      "text": "他没去甲秀楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00027",
      "start_ms": 62160,
      "end_ms": 63565,
      "text": "也没去青岩古镇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00028",
      "start_ms": 63920,
      "end_ms": 66685,
      "text": "直接让人把他拉到乾灵山最高处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00029",
      "start_ms": 67250,
      "end_ms": 68705,
      "text": "俯瞰整座城市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00030",
      "start_ms": 69100,
      "end_ms": 71315,
      "text": "他站在那看了整整一个小时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00031",
      "start_ms": 71850,
      "end_ms": 73790,
      "text": "山风把头发吹得乱七八糟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00032",
      "start_ms": 73810,
      "end_ms": 75570,
      "text": "他就一直盯着脚下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00033",
      "start_ms": 75590,
      "end_ms": 77885,
      "text": "那些从山缝里长出来的娄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00034",
      "start_ms": 78740,
      "end_ms": 80445,
      "text": "然后他突然转过头问我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00035",
      "start_ms": 81300,
      "end_ms": 84755,
      "text": "你知道这座城市最让我震撼的是什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00036",
      "start_ms": 85760,
      "end_ms": 86835,
      "text": "我说山多呗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00037",
      "start_ms": 87520,
      "end_ms": 88625,
      "text": "喀斯特地貌嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00038",
      "start_ms": 88850,
      "end_ms": 89475,
      "text": "他摇头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00039",
      "start_ms": 90300,
      "end_ms": 91880,
      "text": "他说全世界没有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00040",
      "start_ms": 91880,
      "end_ms": 96315,
      "text": "第二个省会是建在百分之八十五的喀斯特地貌上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00041",
      "start_ms": 96890,
      "end_ms": 97410,
      "text": "那一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00042",
      "start_ms": 97430,
      "end_ms": 103355,
      "text": "我突然觉得自己之前对贵阳那些偏远落后的标签遣拨到家了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00043",
      "start_ms": 104790,
      "end_ms": 105915,
      "text": "第一季闷锤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00044",
      "start_ms": 106710,
      "end_ms": 114935,
      "text": "全世界的城市都找平地画格子只有贵阳在百分之八十五都是山河溶洞的土地上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00045",
      "start_ms": 115240,
      "end_ms": 118685,
      "text": "硬生生扎下根来贵阳的地貌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00046",
      "start_ms": 119130,
      "end_ms": 122625,
      "text": "山地、丘陵占百分之八十四点六一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00047",
      "start_ms": 123210,
      "end_ms": 125915,
      "text": "平坝只有百分之十五点三九。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00048",
      "start_ms": 126510,
      "end_ms": 127475,
      "text": "这意味着什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00049",
      "start_ms": 127840,
      "end_ms": 129400,
      "text": "意味着你在这座城市里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00050",
      "start_ms": 129400,
      "end_ms": 130945,
      "text": "随便找个地方往下挖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00051",
      "start_ms": 131590,
      "end_ms": 132910,
      "text": "底下可能是空的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00052",
      "start_ms": 132910,
      "end_ms": 137955,
      "text": "溶洞暗河裂隙平地少到可怜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00053",
      "start_ms": 138370,
      "end_ms": 142495,
      "text": "还被纵横交错的水系切割的七零八落。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00054",
      "start_ms": 143100,
      "end_ms": 145420,
      "text": "可就是这样一块被地理学家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00055",
      "start_ms": 145420,
      "end_ms": 148730,
      "text": "称为不适合建大城市的土地上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00056",
      "start_ms": 148810,
      "end_ms": 151955,
      "text": "长出了一座六百四十万人口的省会。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00057",
      "start_ms": 152500,
      "end_ms": 153880,
      "text": "德国专家说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00058",
      "start_ms": 153880,
      "end_ms": 154975,
      "text": "让我后背发凉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00059",
      "start_ms": 155660,
      "end_ms": 158555,
      "text": "你们中国人在这种地质条件下建城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00060",
      "start_ms": 159320,
      "end_ms": 160685,
      "text": "在欧洲人看来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00061",
      "start_ms": 161140,
      "end_ms": 163885,
      "text": "等于在筛子上盖教堂第二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00062",
      "start_ms": 164190,
      "end_ms": 165725,
      "text": "蓟门锤更狠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00063",
      "start_ms": 166690,
      "end_ms": 167210,
      "text": "第二天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00064",
      "start_ms": 167210,
      "end_ms": 169370,
      "text": "我们钻进了老城区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00065",
      "start_ms": 169390,
      "end_ms": 171895,
      "text": "那些弯弯绕绕的巷子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00066",
      "start_ms": 172380,
      "end_ms": 173920,
      "text": "贵阳不像重庆那样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00067",
      "start_ms": 173920,
      "end_ms": 175955,
      "text": "把楼直接种在山崖上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00068",
      "start_ms": 176400,
      "end_ms": 178570,
      "text": "贵阳市山中有城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00069",
      "start_ms": 178830,
      "end_ms": 179785,
      "text": "城中有山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00070",
      "start_ms": 180310,
      "end_ms": 182790,
      "text": "汉斯蹲在一条叫坡的巷子口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00071",
      "start_ms": 182870,
      "end_ms": 186440,
      "text": "对贵阳的路不叫路叫破老。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00072",
      "start_ms": 186440,
      "end_ms": 192740,
      "text": "贵阳有十八坡、望城婆、大营婆和上坡陈家坡、莲花坡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00073",
      "start_ms": 192740,
      "end_ms": 193765,
      "text": "你听这些名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00074",
      "start_ms": 194110,
      "end_ms": 197670,
      "text": "每一个都是一座实实在在的山望城坡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00075",
      "start_ms": 197690,
      "end_ms": 198555,
      "text": "顾名思义，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00076",
      "start_ms": 198830,
      "end_ms": 202010,
      "text": "就是能望见贵阳城的坡大营坡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00077",
      "start_ms": 202010,
      "end_ms": 205235,
      "text": "几乎全贵阳人都知道河上坡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00078",
      "start_ms": 205620,
      "end_ms": 207375,
      "text": "在今天白云大道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00079",
      "start_ms": 208010,
      "end_ms": 212435,
      "text": "他用手摸着那些被岁月磨圆的青石板。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00080",
      "start_ms": 212990,
      "end_ms": 213715,
      "text": "突然问我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00081",
      "start_ms": 213990,
      "end_ms": 214795,
      "text": "你注意到没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00082",
      "start_ms": 215290,
      "end_ms": 217950,
      "text": "贵阳人从来没有试图把山铲平。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00083",
      "start_ms": 218250,
      "end_ms": 218610,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00084",
      "start_ms": 218870,
      "end_ms": 221565,
      "text": "全世界山地城市的逻辑就两种，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00085",
      "start_ms": 222090,
      "end_ms": 224605,
      "text": "要么推山填谷造平地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00086",
      "start_ms": 225030,
      "end_ms": 228385,
      "text": "要么像重庆那样把楼架在山壁上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00087",
      "start_ms": 229180,
      "end_ms": 231205,
      "text": "但贵阳选了第三条路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00088",
      "start_ms": 232210,
      "end_ms": 234555,
      "text": "他绕着山走山在这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00089",
      "start_ms": 234960,
      "end_ms": 236905,
      "text": "路就拐个弯儿泼在那儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00090",
      "start_ms": 237100,
      "end_ms": 240035,
      "text": "房子就顺着坡盖几十年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00091",
      "start_ms": 240410,
      "end_ms": 244035,
      "text": "贵阳人硬是没动过那些山的基本轮廓。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00092",
      "start_ms": 244740,
      "end_ms": 246945,
      "text": "他站起来指着远处说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00093",
      "start_ms": 247490,
      "end_ms": 249675,
      "text": "你们贵阳人不是在修城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00094",
      "start_ms": 250070,
      "end_ms": 252835,
      "text": "你们是在卡斯特的骨头缝里绣花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00095",
      "start_ms": 253490,
      "end_ms": 259295,
      "text": "每一栋楼每一条路都是顺着地形的纹理长出来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00096",
      "start_ms": 259750,
      "end_ms": 261515,
      "text": "这种对自然的敬畏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00097",
      "start_ms": 261870,
      "end_ms": 262745,
      "text": "不是妥协，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00098",
      "start_ms": 263110,
      "end_ms": 263825,
      "text": "是智慧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00099",
      "start_ms": 264300,
      "end_ms": 267075,
      "text": "然后他说了一句让我头皮发麻的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00100",
      "start_ms": 267890,
      "end_ms": 269770,
      "text": "我们欧洲人搞了几百年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00101",
      "start_ms": 269770,
      "end_ms": 272835,
      "text": "城市规划讲究的是改造自然，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00102",
      "start_ms": 273130,
      "end_ms": 274515,
      "text": "征服地形哦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00103",
      "start_ms": 275070,
      "end_ms": 279015,
      "text": "但你们贵阳人从一开始就想明白了一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00104",
      "start_ms": 279480,
      "end_ms": 282580,
      "text": "最高级的文明不是让山河沉浮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00105",
      "start_ms": 282900,
      "end_ms": 285055,
      "text": "是知道什么时候该绕着走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00106",
      "start_ms": 285500,
      "end_ms": 286545,
      "text": "第三季闷锤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00107",
      "start_ms": 287360,
      "end_ms": 289560,
      "text": "我们去了一个谁也想不到的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00108",
      "start_ms": 289560,
      "end_ms": 294100,
      "text": "贵阳三县建设博物馆汉斯站在那些老照片和老物件前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00109",
      "start_ms": 294100,
      "end_ms": 294800,
      "text": "看了很久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00110",
      "start_ms": 295119,
      "end_ms": 296385,
      "text": "突然转过头问我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00111",
      "start_ms": 296760,
      "end_ms": 302305,
      "text": "你知道为什么贵阳能从一座边陲小城变成今天的西南枢纽吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00112",
      "start_ms": 302680,
      "end_ms": 303435,
      "text": "我愣了愣。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00113",
      "start_ms": 303810,
      "end_ms": 304170,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00114",
      "start_ms": 304710,
      "end_ms": 308730,
      "text": "因为你们贵阳人把被选择变成了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00115",
      "start_ms": 308730,
      "end_ms": 309310,
      "text": "接得住。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00116",
      "start_ms": 310030,
      "end_ms": 326830,
      "text": "一九六四年三县建设启动国家一址调令数万名工人技术员工程师、携家带口技术、海北京、沈阳哈尔滨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00117",
      "start_ms": 327070,
      "end_ms": 329590,
      "text": "这些大城市挤上孟灌货车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00118",
      "start_ms": 329910,
      "end_ms": 331450,
      "text": "翻过重鸾叠嶂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00119",
      "start_ms": 331910,
      "end_ms": 334640,
      "text": "落脚在这片全然木场陌生的土地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00120",
      "start_ms": 335620,
      "end_ms": 336500,
      "text": "十五年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00121",
      "start_ms": 336780,
      "end_ms": 340220,
      "text": "一百多个项目从沿海迁入贵州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00122",
      "start_ms": 340960,
      "end_ms": 341720,
      "text": "仅内迁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00123",
      "start_ms": 341739,
      "end_ms": 343680,
      "text": "职工就超过七万人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00124",
      "start_ms": 344260,
      "end_ms": 356140,
      "text": "设备一万二千余台相当于搬走了好几座中型城市上海光学仪器厂整体迁到乌当区新天寨的山窝窝里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00125",
      "start_ms": 356520,
      "end_ms": 359660,
      "text": "在代号八百零三的四层小楼中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00126",
      "start_ms": 360180,
      "end_ms": 363525,
      "text": "硬是造出了中国第一台潜艇潜望镜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00127",
      "start_ms": 364130,
      "end_ms": 367590,
      "text": "上海第二电表厂上海电表厂迁到贵阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00128",
      "start_ms": 367650,
      "end_ms": 369945,
      "text": "组建了西南电表公司。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00129",
      "start_ms": 370430,
      "end_ms": 373550,
      "text": "上海大中华橡胶厂整体内迁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00130",
      "start_ms": 373590,
      "end_ms": 376515,
      "text": "贵阳组建贵州橡胶总厂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00131",
      "start_ms": 376880,
      "end_ms": 379285,
      "text": "北京轴承厂一拆为二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00132",
      "start_ms": 380110,
      "end_ms": 382355,
      "text": "一半来贵阳小河扎根。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00133",
      "start_ms": 382880,
      "end_ms": 383320,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00134",
      "start_ms": 383480,
      "end_ms": 387505,
      "text": "GY排轴承远销七十多个国家和地区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00135",
      "start_ms": 387870,
      "end_ms": 390115,
      "text": "拿下了全国五一劳动奖状，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00136",
      "start_ms": 390570,
      "end_ms": 398230,
      "text": "还有永恒精密电表厂紧挨着油炸街的火焰山生产的产品参与研制。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00137",
      "start_ms": 398270,
      "end_ms": 403905,
      "text": "北京正负电子对撞机名字被永远刻在了国家科委的铭文碑上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00138",
      "start_ms": 404570,
      "end_ms": 407330,
      "text": "汉斯站在博物馆里一字一句的说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00139",
      "start_ms": 407670,
      "end_ms": 409495,
      "text": "你知道这意味着什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00140",
      "start_ms": 410390,
      "end_ms": 412595,
      "text": "这不是一座城市的幸运，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00141",
      "start_ms": 413150,
      "end_ms": 415235,
      "text": "这是一座城市的品格。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00142",
      "start_ms": 415780,
      "end_ms": 418165,
      "text": "你们贵阳人没有挑三拣四，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00143",
      "start_ms": 418720,
      "end_ms": 420585,
      "text": "不管国家扔进来什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00144",
      "start_ms": 420990,
      "end_ms": 422075,
      "text": "你们都接住了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00145",
      "start_ms": 423100,
      "end_ms": 424015,
      "text": "上海人来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00146",
      "start_ms": 424880,
      "end_ms": 426005,
      "text": "贵阳人没排外，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00147",
      "start_ms": 426840,
      "end_ms": 427920,
      "text": "东北人来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00148",
      "start_ms": 428020,
      "end_ms": 429255,
      "text": "贵阳人没嫌弃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00149",
      "start_ms": 430080,
      "end_ms": 431200,
      "text": "你们把山挖开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00150",
      "start_ms": 431320,
      "end_ms": 432195,
      "text": "把路修通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00151",
      "start_ms": 432490,
      "end_ms": 433430,
      "text": "把厂建起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00152",
      "start_ms": 433430,
      "end_ms": 437265,
      "text": "山沟里硬生生长出了一座现代工业城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00153",
      "start_ms": 437730,
      "end_ms": 439385,
      "text": "他顿了顿又说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00154",
      "start_ms": 440570,
      "end_ms": 441810,
      "text": "更让我震撼的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00155",
      "start_ms": 441850,
      "end_ms": 443205,
      "text": "你们不但截住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00156",
      "start_ms": 443510,
      "end_ms": 445325,
      "text": "还长出了新的东西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00157",
      "start_ms": 445940,
      "end_ms": 449200,
      "text": "六十年前三线建设打下的工业底子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00158",
      "start_ms": 449480,
      "end_ms": 451575,
      "text": "六十年后变成了什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00159",
      "start_ms": 451860,
      "end_ms": 454320,
      "text": "变成了今天贵阳的中国树谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00160",
      "start_ms": 454320,
      "end_ms": 456715,
      "text": "那些曾经的三线工厂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00161",
      "start_ms": 457150,
      "end_ms": 459255,
      "text": "如今变成了大数据产业园，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00162",
      "start_ms": 459690,
      "end_ms": 460895,
      "text": "机械加工车间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00163",
      "start_ms": 461180,
      "end_ms": 463285,
      "text": "变成了软件测试实验室。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00164",
      "start_ms": 464060,
      "end_ms": 465165,
      "text": "凉爽的气候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00165",
      "start_ms": 465470,
      "end_ms": 470975,
      "text": "稳定的地址、充足的水电当年是三县建设选址的理由，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00166",
      "start_ms": 471540,
      "end_ms": 474665,
      "text": "今天成了大数据产业扎根的土壤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00167",
      "start_ms": 475580,
      "end_ms": 477780,
      "text": "从潜望镜到云计算，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00168",
      "start_ms": 477860,
      "end_ms": 480740,
      "text": "从山洞里的机床到云端上的代码。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00169",
      "start_ms": 480760,
      "end_ms": 484095,
      "text": "你们贵阳人用六十年证明了一件事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00170",
      "start_ms": 484450,
      "end_ms": 485755,
      "text": "你给我什么样的地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00171",
      "start_ms": 486110,
      "end_ms": 487485,
      "text": "我就能活出什么样的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00172",
      "start_ms": 488430,
      "end_ms": 489955,
      "text": "你给我什么样的时代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00173",
      "start_ms": 490420,
      "end_ms": 492585,
      "text": "我就能借住什么样的未来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00174",
      "start_ms": 493330,
      "end_ms": 494635,
      "text": "我站在博物馆里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00175",
      "start_ms": 495110,
      "end_ms": 497950,
      "text": "看着墙上那些黑白照片里年轻的脸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00176",
      "start_ms": 497950,
      "end_ms": 499105,
      "text": "他们从上海来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00177",
      "start_ms": 499540,
      "end_ms": 500625,
      "text": "从北京来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00178",
      "start_ms": 500990,
      "end_ms": 501865,
      "text": "从东北来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00179",
      "start_ms": 502290,
      "end_ms": 504030,
      "text": "有的连贵州在哪都不知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00180",
      "start_ms": 504030,
      "end_ms": 504675,
      "text": "就到了了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00181",
      "start_ms": 505320,
      "end_ms": 506615,
      "text": "他们这辈子没回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00182",
      "start_ms": 506840,
      "end_ms": 511560,
      "text": "把青春和子孙都留在了这片喀斯特的山地上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00183",
      "start_ms": 511660,
      "end_ms": 512435,
      "text": "回来之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00184",
      "start_ms": 512780,
      "end_ms": 514395,
      "text": "我怎么也放不下这件事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00185",
      "start_ms": 514940,
      "end_ms": 516125,
      "text": "搜了一圈资料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00186",
      "start_ms": 516530,
      "end_ms": 521005,
      "text": "发现大部分文章都在讲贵阳有多爽有多凉快。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00187",
      "start_ms": 521420,
      "end_ms": 525735,
      "text": "很少有人讲贵阳背后那个文明级别的生存选择。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00188",
      "start_ms": 526280,
      "end_ms": 528645,
      "text": "后来翻到那套中国历史名城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00189",
      "start_ms": 529140,
      "end_ms": 531765,
      "text": "翻到贵阳那部分一口气读完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00190",
      "start_ms": 532230,
      "end_ms": 535145,
      "text": "他不是把贵阳当一个避暑城市来写，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00191",
      "start_ms": 535700,
      "end_ms": 536680,
      "text": "他掰开了讲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00192",
      "start_ms": 537060,
      "end_ms": 541520,
      "text": "为什么中国人敢在百分之八十五都是卡斯特的山地上见省会？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00193",
      "start_ms": 542060,
      "end_ms": 544700,
      "text": "为什么山城不是被迫接受，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00194",
      "start_ms": 544720,
      "end_ms": 546180,
      "text": "而是主动共生？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00195",
      "start_ms": 546360,
      "end_ms": 552280,
      "text": "为什么中国文明能把一块地无三里坪的土地活成西南枢纽？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00196",
      "start_ms": 552890,
      "end_ms": 554470,
      "text": "每一页翻开都是一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00197",
      "start_ms": 554630,
      "end_ms": 557210,
      "text": "原来我们的祖宗在不可能，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00198",
      "start_ms": 557210,
      "end_ms": 560495,
      "text": "这三个字面前从来没低过头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00199",
      "start_ms": 561210,
      "end_ms": 562730,
      "text": "下次你要是来贵阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00200",
      "start_ms": 562870,
      "end_ms": 565205,
      "text": "别光在甲秀楼拍张游客照就走了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00201",
      "start_ms": 566020,
      "end_ms": 567325,
      "text": "翻一翻这套书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00202",
      "start_ms": 567970,
      "end_ms": 570275,
      "text": "带一双看得懂的眼睛走进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00203",
      "start_ms": 571190,
      "end_ms": 575815,
      "text": "这座在卡斯特骨头缝里绣了六百多年花的山城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00204",
      "start_ms": 576490,
      "end_ms": 578690,
      "text": "等的不是一个游客说挺凉快，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00205",
      "start_ms": 578690,
      "end_ms": 579510,
      "text": "然后走掉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00206",
      "start_ms": 579610,
      "end_ms": 580210,
      "text": "等的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00207",
      "start_ms": 580330,
      "end_ms": 583185,
      "text": "终于有个中国人站在乾灵山顶说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00208",
      "start_ms": 583700,
      "end_ms": 586465,
      "text": "我知道你是什么你是我的祖宗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00209",
      "start_ms": 586900,
      "end_ms": 590775,
      "text": "在一堆石头缝里跟这片山地达成的一个约定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00210",
      "start_ms": 591190,
      "end_ms": 594645,
      "text": "至今没有毁约放在橱窗里了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00211",
      "start_ms": 594880,
      "end_ms": 596800,
      "text": "点左下角头像主页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00212",
      "start_ms": 596800,
      "end_ms": 601995,
      "text": "橱窗就能看到一顿肠旺面加两份翠少的钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00213",
      "start_ms": 602600,
      "end_ms": 606875,
      "text": "把中国人在不可能的土地上活出可能的骨气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b199dcc6960a2707_s00214",
      "start_ms": 607420,
      "end_ms": 609025,
      "text": "原原本本带回家。"
    }
  ],
